WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:05.500
Near-white footage, where a white line usually disappears.

00:06.500 --> 00:11.500
A moving checkerboard: every pixel under the line keeps flipping.

00:12.500 --> 00:17.500
Fully saturated colour bars.

00:18.500 --> 00:23.500
Static, which averages out to middle grey.

00:24.500 --> 00:29.500
And black.
